Z||000013||AusFiero||07-09-2001||11:46 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Monkeyman:<BR><B>No problem, Steve.  I've seen your work.  Outstanding!  Unfortunately, I'm still in the stone age with a dial up modem.  We got teased with DSL for about a year, but now they claim that we're not even on the "future" list.  I had a few choice words to say to the (expletive deleted) phone company.  We're supposed to get cable this fall, but I won't hold my breath.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Sounds like my phone company MM. I bought land here cause cable was going through. For 2 years I copped 3 months, 3 months. Now I cop, oh no we never intended to put cable there we have stopped running any more.<P>Now I got permanent dialup connection. Nice being online permanently but bloody slow.<BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/fiero5.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A><BR>Need a Subwoofer Console or Speaker Door Pods?||||reg||1
